@startuml Convoy Planning

title Planning a convoy: route, truck list, budget, equipment, crew, leader and bookings
caption Target design. Decisions P15, O12, O13, D17, P14, P9, O7, P1, P2, P8, O4, O30, P11, D35. ADRs 0007, 0008, 0012.

autonumber

actor Dispatcher as disp
actor Administrator as admin
participant "Freedom API" as api
database "Freedom database" as db

== Create the convoy ==
disp -> api : create convoy (dates)
disp -> api : PUT route: ordered points, each with a name and kind\n(stop, overnight, border + authority, hub)
api -> db : merge route points (ids stay stable)
note right of api
  Overnight stops are flagged by the Dispatcher.
  The service never calculates routes or times (P15).
end note

== Truck list ==
loop for each vehicle
  disp -> api : add vehicle to the truck list
  api -> db : only if inspection Passed
end
disp -> api : publish truck list

== Creation steps: budget and equipment ==
disp -> api : set budget lines (fuel, ferry, hotel, insurance, other)
note right : Not required to depart; unset is a warning (O37)
disp -> api : add vehicle equipment (e.g. warning triangles)
note right : No donor, not part of value delivered (O13)

== Crew and leader ==
loop for each vehicle
  disp -> api : seat a person (Driver or Passenger)
  api -> db : one seat per person per convoy (no legs)
end
disp -> api : nominate Convoy Leader (a Driver on the convoy)
api -> db : close previous assignment, open new one (history kept)
note right of disp
  Only a Dispatcher or Administrator may reassign (P14).
end note

== Insurance ==
disp -> api : record insurance (insurer, policy, cover dates, drivers covered)
alt a driver is added later
  api -> db : seat the driver
  note right : the new driver is uncovered until the policy is updated (O7)
  disp -> api : record the updated policy
else a crew member is removed
  api -> db : remove seat; insurance stays in cover for the others
end

== Bookings and handover ==
loop for each vehicle
  disp -> api : ferry booking (outbound only, reference, ticket, cost)
  disp -> api : handover Receiver
  api -> db : Receiver must be **registered** (P11, D35)
end
loop for each overnight stop
  disp -> api : book accommodation for crew members (may be shared)
  disp -> api : or flag a crew member as arranging their own (O30)
end

== Readiness is shown as it is completed ==
disp -> api : GET readiness
api --> disp : blocking items and advisory warnings, each with a link to fix it

@enduml
